WEBVTT

00:08:26.761 --> 00:08:30.222
leading to complete and permanent paralysis.

00:08:30.222 --> 00:08:32.209
In fact --

00:08:32.209 --> 00:08:33.929
(Applause)

00:08:33.929 --> 00:08:38.308
Thank you.

00:08:38.308 --> 00:08:41.402
In fact, not only could the rat initiate

00:08:41.402 --> 00:08:44.079
and sustain locomotion on the ground,

00:08:44.079 --> 00:08:46.360
they could even adjust leg movement,

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:48.716
for example, to resist gravity

00:08:48.716 --> 00:08:51.340
in order to climb a staircase.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:53.290
I can promise you this was

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:56.399
such an emotional moment in my laboratory.

00:08:56.399 --> 00:08:59.142
It took us 10 years of hard work

00:08:59.142 --> 00:09:01.593
to reach this goal.